# Local scanner suppression baseline (SkillSpector). Records which findings a
# human reviewed and accepted. It is local state: no CI in this repo consumes
# it, and no sibling repository tracks one. Kept under
# memory/skillspector-baseline-dev-masterkit-2026-10-27.yaml in the workspace
# repo so the review decisions are not lost.
.skillspector-baseline.yaml

